# Implementation plan — Spec 1.8.0

## Summary

Spec 1.8.0 adds **`PageHeader`** and **`FeaturePage`** to `@webonone/ui-kit` for consistent feature-page structure inside `AppShell`, refactors WebOnOne v2 settings/home pages, adds **Identity dual sidebar navigation** (standalone vs core redirect), adds a showcase demo, and creates **`feature-page-layout.mdc`**. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-feature-page-layout.md](./02-feature-page-layout.md), [03-cursor-rule.md](./03-cursor-rule.md), [04-identity-navigation.md](./04-identity-navigation.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.8.0` |
| Package builds | `npm run build -w @webonone/platform-nav` and `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before consumer prod builds |
| Vite alias | Consumers alias workspace packages to `src/` in dev |

