## Phase 5 — Identity dual navigation

**Goal:** Mutually exclusive sidebars — Identity nav (standalone) or full core nav (redirect).

**Exit criteria:** Type-check passes; behavior per [04-identity-navigation.md](./04-identity-navigation.md).

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Shared core paths | `packages/platform-nav/src/coreNav.ts` |
| WebOnOne nav + redirect | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts`, `features/auth/utils/redirectToIdentityProfile.ts`, `app/AppLayout.tsx` |
| Identity nav | `identity/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts` — `buildStandaloneNav()`, `buildCoreNavFromQuery()` |
| Identity layout | `identity/frontend/src/app/AppLayout.tsx` — switch nav + logo by `return_url` |
| ProfilePage | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/pages/ProfilePage.tsx` — remove inline back link |

**Verify:** `npm run build -w @webonone/platform-nav`; `npm run type-check -w identity-root`

---

## Phase 6 — Identity standalone welcome / login

**Goal:** Standalone `/login` shows `FeaturePage` welcome with Identity sidebar; redirect/embed login unchanged.

**Exit criteria:** Type-check passes; `:3001/login` shows sidebar + welcome header.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Home nav item | `identity/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts` — add Home → `/login` |
| Shell route + layout | `navItems.ts` — include `/login` in `IDENTITY_SHELL_ROUTES`; `AppLayout.tsx` — skip shell when `redirect_uri` present |
| LoginPage welcome | `identity/frontend/src/features/auth/pages/LoginPage.tsx` — standalone: `FeaturePage`; redirect: `AuthLayout` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`

---

## Cross-service integration

- **WebOnOne → Identity profile:** `redirectWithAuthCode` + `return_url` + `core_nav` ([`redirectToIdentityProfile.ts`](../../webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/auth/utils/redirectToIdentityProfile.ts)).
- **Shared nav paths:** `@webonone/platform-nav` `coreNav.ts` — WebOnOne relative paths; Identity absolute URLs from `return_url` origin.
- Identity reads validated `return_url` via `parseProfileReturnUrl()` — no new env keys.

