## Risks and open items

- `SystemThemePage` "Create theme" button moves to `PageHeader` `actions` — verify flex wrap on narrow viewports.
- `/forgot-password` not in sidebar — reachable from login footer only.
- No active highlight on core nav items while on Identity `/profile` (external routes).

